This pack is an adaptation for the Indian market (NSE) of day-trader-skill,
https://github.com/Jakeschincariol/day-trader-skill, Copyright (c) 2026 Jake Schincariol,
released under the MIT License. The structure (eleven skills, each a SKILL.md and a
standard-library Python tool, joined through a shared trader/ folder), the safety rules and
the method of each skill come from that project. The code, data sources, calendar,
currency, tests and fixtures in this repository were rewritten for NSE and SEBI data.

Both copyright lines are kept in LICENSE, as the MIT License requires.

Data: the tools read free public data (Yahoo Finance, NSE and the SEBI disclosures NSE
publishes, Google News RSS). That data belongs to its owners and is used under their own
terms. The fixtures in tests/fixtures are small saved samples of those answers, kept so the
tests run offline.
